DESCRIPTION
  Lightweight window manager for X11.
  Written in C with minimal dependencies and macro-based design.

FEATURES
  - Keyboard and mouse control
  - Focus follows mouse
  - Move and resize windows with MOD + left/right mouse button
  - Fullscreen, centering and window cycling
  - Configurable keybindings via config.h

BUILD
  make
  make install PREFIX=/usr

REQUIREMENTS
  - X11 development libraries (libx11-dev)
  - GCC compiler
  - POSIX environment

CONFIGURATION
  Edit config.h before building to customize keybindings and behavior.

USAGE
  Start from .xinitrc or display manager, for example:
    exec qqqwm
